``` Rogue or compromised roaming network
    Phones accept the challenge, but RES* doesn't match because it is
    bound to the serving network name. Several of our subscribers
    failing like this through the same network means that network is
    reusing or relaying challenges made for someone else.
    Threshold: 3 distinct subscribers per network per 10 minutes. ```
index=fiveg source="traffic.jsonl" event_type=auth_failure cause=RES_MISMATCH
| bin _time span=10m
| stats count dc(subscriber) as subscribers values(cell) as cells by _time serving_network
| where subscribers >= 3
